{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t啟德德朗邨一名93歲婆婆，懷疑被外傭施襲後失去知覺，送院後死亡，照顧她的52歲外傭涉嫌謀殺被捕。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方指翻查錄影片段，涉案外傭疑短時間內擊打事主約20次。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：朱錫君\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T12:19:06.374030+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":84,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T11:55:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T12:37:41.852400+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T12:17:43.025660+00:00","content_hash":"11b3fa06bba182aecdd34a790ed4d2a5e81484b8731591581efbe9db32c09198","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}